indications_limitations:
&lt;p&gt;Beginning July 1, 2001, Medicare covers FDG-PET for pre-surgical evaluation for the purpose of localization of a focus of refractory seizure activity.&lt;&sol;p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Limitations: Covered only for pre-surgical evaluation.&lt;&sol;p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Documentation that these conditions are met should be maintained by the referring physician in the beneficiary&#39;s medical record, as is normal business practice.&lt;&sol;p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;(This NCD last reviewed June 2001.)&lt;&sol;p&gt;
